    "description": "Bootstrap: this task IS the dogfood \u2014 Sprint 18 itself is being authored as scenario.json units (this file, the Sprint unit 5b950725-..., the other Task units, the Requirement units when req-eng commits them, and the UseCase/Class/Method units when architect commits them). T126 ViewGenerator (R17.7-R17.10) emits scrum.pmo/sprints/sprint-18-chain-method-scope/planning.md + task-187-*.md + task-188-*.md + task-189-*.md from the scenario units. The .md files become generated views, not hand-authored source. Verifies the S17 model can author a sprint end-to-end from units.",
